<sect2 id="gimp-view-show-rulers">
  <title>Exibir réguas</title>

  <indexterm>
    <primary>Réguas</primary>
    <secondary>Exibir/esconder réguas</secondary>
  </indexterm>
  <indexterm>
    <primary>Exibir réguas</primary>
  </indexterm>

  <para>O comando <guimenuitem>Exibir réguas</guimenuitem> ativa e desativa a exibição das réguas. Pode ser útil desativa-las ao se trabalhar no  <link linkend="gimp-view-fullscreen">modo de tela cheia</link>.</para>
  <para>
    You can set the default for the rulers in the
    <link linkend="gimp-prefs-image-window-appearance">Image Window Appearance Preferences</link>.
  </para>

  <sect3>
    <title>Ativando o comando</title>
    <itemizedlist>
      <listitem>
        <para>
          You can access this command from the main menu through
          <menuchoice>
            <guimenu>View</guimenu>
            <guimenuitem>Show Rulers</guimenuitem>
          </menuchoice>.
        </para>
      </listitem>
      <listitem>
        <para>
          You can also use the keyboard shortcut
          <keycombo>
            <keycap>Shift</keycap>
            <keycap>Ctrl</keycap>
            <keycap>R</keycap>
          </keycombo>.
        </para>
      </listitem>
    </itemizedlist>
  </sect3>
</sect2>
